  "downloads": 4475,
  "description": "<p>Been testing and modifying this for a while with my friend our aim was; making pmc’s loadouts more likely to live tarkov and changed lots of stuff on the config, the weapon and gear pool is extended, less chance to pmc’s have pistol, loot generated on their backpacks and much more.</p>\n<h1>Installation</h1>\n<ol>\n<li>Paste the mod into your spt folder and override the files. (<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://imgur.com/a/9jxeSHW\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://imgur.com/a/9jxeSHW</a>)</li>\n<li>Set the preset from the web config. (<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://imgur.com/a/NS5sTCB\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://imgur.com/a/NS5sTCB</a>)</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>DISCLAIMER</h2>\n<p>If you dont want to lose your <em>config file</em> <strong>please backup</strong> before you install the mod so if you dont like the mod you can use your old config again.</p>\n<h3>Contact</h3>\n<p>You can contact me from discord, my username is jsjsj012. Feel free to tell any suggestion/feedback to me.</p>\n",
